<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in light trading on Friday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average up 22.36 to 6521.70.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite up 0.95 to 398.43.</p>
<p>The average price per share up $0.10.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1305 to 906.</p>
<p>Volume was 149,840,350, compared with 377,106,430 Wednesday.</p>
<p>	    (Prices official as of 1335 EST/1835 GMT).</p>
